  "provenance": {
    "created": "2026-10-21",
    "adapter": "Open Genjutsu single-batch API graph based on verified native schemas; no UI subgraphs or cache.",
    "template": "https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/blob/main/templates/video_wan_animate2_distilled.json",
    "templateLicense": "https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/blob/main/LICENSE",
    "modelCard": "https://huggingface.co/Wan-AI/Wan2.2-Animate-2-14B",
    "modelLicense": "https://github.com/Wan-Video/Wan-Animate-2/blob/main/LICENSE",
    "nativeNodes": "https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/blob/master/comfy_extras/nodes_wan.py",
    "videoNodes": "https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/blob/master/comfy_extras/nodes_video.py",
    "notes": [
      "Source-derived schema/wiring check only; no successful generation claimed.",
      "Normalize source to24fps, max49frames and max480px before upload. Align reference framing with the driving opening pose.",
      "No audio is copied in this tiny preview.",
      "Width/height must be multiples16; frames must be4n+1.",
      "Native official INT8 checkpoint16.7GB + FP16 UMT511.4GB + CLIP1.26GB + VAE0.254GB is about29.6GB of files before activations. This is a heavy compatibility profile, NOT a recommended24GB Mac default.",
      "FP16 CPU text encoding avoids assuming MPS supports FP8; it adds substantial RAM/runtime cost. Native INT8 ConvRot MPS support remains unverified.",
      "Distilled sampling follows current official template:10steps, LCM, simple, cfg1, sampling shift5. Cache omitted for memory.",
      "Do not simply swap to a GGUF checkpoint in UNETLoader. Animate2 GGUF requires correct explicit architecture metadata; otherwise driving video can be silently ignored."
    ]
  }
}
